<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg to issue four bln Lfr of bonds in 1998.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg to issue four bln Lfr of bonds in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg government said on Wednesday it will issue bonds worth a total of four billion Luxembourg francs in 1998, the same figure as planned for 1997.</p>
<p>The borrowing, three billion francs of which will be spent on roads, forms part of the 1998 budget that was outlined earlier in the day.</p>
<p>-- Luxembourg Newsroom +352 47 51 51 200, fax 352 47 42 52</p>
</text>
